/URI (https://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=2026%20NAAS-AJAS%20Annual%20Conference%20Registration&dates=20260211T050000Z/20260214T050000Z&details=Congratulations+to+the+2026%26nbsp%3BAJAS+Fellows%21%26nbsp%3B%0D%0A%0D%0AWe+are+honored+to+celebrate+your+success+at+the+2026%26nbsp%3BNAAS-AJAS%26nbsp%3BAnnual+Conference+and+view+your+research+at+the+2026%26nbsp%3BAJAS%26nbsp%3BPoster+Session.%0D%0A%0D%0A%0D%0A%09Thoroughly+review+the+Registration+Information+Page+before+registering.%0D%0A%09The+email+address+you+enter+in+this+form%26nbsp%3Bwill+be+used+for+sending+out+Annual+Conference+information.%26nbsp%3B%0D%0A%09In+this+registration+form%2C+AJAS+Official+Delegates+must%26nbsp%3Bprovide%3A%0D%0A%09%0D%0A%09%09names+and+email+addresses+for+their+adult+chaperone%0D%0A%09%09names+and+email+addresses+for+their+state+or+regional+science+academy+director%2C+teacher+and%2For+research+mentor%0D%0A%09%09abstract+title+and+text.%26nbsp%3B%0D%0A%09%0D%0A%09%0D%0A%09Before+submitting+this+registration+form%2C+AJAS+Official+Delegates+must+also+upload+their+abstract+title+and+text+to+AAAS+to+be+featured+in+their+program.+Do+not+proceed+with+the+registration+process+until+you+are+prepared+to+submit+your+research+abstract+and+title+to+AAAS.%0D%0A%09Payments+must+be+submitted+at+the+time+of+registration.+Please+plan+accordingly+if+someone+else+is+paying+for+your+registration.%0D%0A%09State+and+regional+academies+of+science+must+have+their+2026%26nbsp%3BNAAS+membership+dues+paid+prior+to+registering+students+and+adults+for+the+NAAS%2FAJAS+Annual+Conference.%0D%0A%09Read+carefully+through+your+confirmation+email.+If+you+have+questions+or+need+to+make+any+changes%2C+contact+AJAS%26nbsp%3Badministrator+Lindsay+Thompson%26nbsp%3Bat+admin%40academiesofscience.org%26nbsp%3B.%26nbsp%3B%0D%0A%0D%0AFor+2026%2C+all+registrants+%28delegates%2C+observers%2C+parents%2C+chaperones%2C+etc.%29+pay+%24475+which+includes+AJAS+registration+%28%24400%29+and+AAAS+registration+%28%2475%29.+Do+not+register+separately+for+AAAS%21%26nbsp%3BAdditional+Details%3A+PLEASE+SAVE+THIS+MESSAGE%0D%0A%0D%0AWe+look+forward+to+seeing+you+in+Phoenix%2C+AZ%21%26nbsp%3B%0D%0A%0D%0AYou+have+3+more+tasks+to+complete%21%0D%0A%0D%0A%09Don%27t+forget+to+reserve+your+hotel+room%26nbsp%3B%28information+at+the+bottom+of+the+page%29%0D%0A%09Download+and+log+into+our+new+to+this+year+Conference+App%21+%28The+app+is+not+updated+for+2026+yet%2C%26nbsp%3Bbut+can+be+used+as+a+general+guideline.%29%0D%0A%09%0D%0A%09%09Apple%3A%26nbsp%3Bhttps%3A%2F%2Fapps.apple.com%2Fus%2Fapp%2Fnaas-ajas-mobile-app%2Fid6683282923%0D%0A%09%09Android%3A%26nbsp%3Bhttps%3A%2F%2Fplay.google.com%2Fstore%2Fapps%2Fdetails%3Fid%3Dcom.viethconsulting.NAASNAASMobile%26amp%3Bpli%3D1%0D%0A%09%0D%0A%09%0D%0A%09Arrange+your+travel+plans+%28Arrival+information+at+the+bottom+of+the+page%29%26nbsp%3B+%26nbsp%3B+%26nbsp%3B+%26nbsp%3B%0D%0A%0D%0A&location=,Phoenix,AZ%20&trp=false&sprop=&sprop=name:)>>
/StructParent 100005>>
